**Australian Law Note (2026-05-28):** This project is a recruitment platform operating in Australia. It collects, stores, and processes personal information of jobseekers (including swipes, matches, profiles, work rights, availability, and location data) and is subject to the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth), the Fair Work Act 2009 (Cth), the Disability Discrimination Act 1992 (Cth), and applicable state laws (Victoria). All contributions and usage must comply with these statutes. See `docs/legal/` for current compliance guidance (AU_FAIR_WORK_PAY_TRANSPARENCY_CASUAL_2026.md, PRIVACY_ACT_RECRUITMENT_JOBSEEKER_DATA_2026.md and related).

Governing law: Victoria, Australia. Disputes resolved under Victorian jurisdiction.

